  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/wNf00fvN/lios-overhauled-villages.png\" alt=\"lios重构村庄\" border=\"0\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">欢迎来到 <strong>Lio's Overhauled Villages</strong>！本模组对村庄进行了全面改造，为其注入了更现代、更充满活力的氛围。体验升级的建筑结构、互动元素，以及隐藏在每座村庄图书馆中等待你探索的秘密与彩蛋。<br><br></p>\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/FkZp6Lwt/villages.png\" alt=\"村庄\" width=\"434\" height=\"55\" border=\"0\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>平原村庄</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>针叶林村庄</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>沙漠村庄</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>热带草原村庄</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>积雪冻原村庄</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/mrsKQ5m4/compatibility.png\" alt=\"兼容性\" width=\"645\" height=\"55\" border=\"0\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><em>本模组与大多数其他模组兼容，并应能正常工作于任何村庄扩展模组。不过，如果您需要专门的兼容性支持，可以在这里找到！</em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">-&gt; <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/lios-universal-village-compat-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Lio的村庄兼容性数据包</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 14px 16px; border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.12); border-radius: 12px; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.03);\">\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/lioloader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; text-decoration: none;\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/wrK85wgc/logo.png\" alt=\"LioLoader\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" style=\"display:block; border-radius: 12px;\">\n    <div style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.35;\">\n      <div style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: inherit;\">需要基于数据包的配置？</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size: 14px; color: inherit; opacity: 0.9;\">\n        试试 <strong>LioLoader</strong> 实现全局数据包/资源包加载。适用于 <strong>Minecraft 1.21.x</strong> 的 <strong>NeoForge</strong> 和 <strong>Fabric</strong>。\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"font-size: 13px; color: inherit; opacity: 0.85; margin-top: 4px;\">在 Modrinth 上查看 LioLoader →</div>\n    </div>\n  </a>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n  <br /><br /><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/3pzCfkM/1.png\" alt=\"平原村庄\" width=\"946\" height=\"488\" /><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/brDfvmC/2.png\" alt=\"平原村庄全景\" width=\"946\" height=\"488\" /><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/7jY72vN/3.png\" alt=\"平原村庄房屋内部\" width=\"946\" height=\"488\" /><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/zQWZvMn/14.png\" alt=\"针叶林村庄概览\" width=\"946\" height=\"488\" /><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/1sfBMpg/15.png\" alt=\"针叶林村庄侧视图\" width=\"946\" height=\"488\" /><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/YTqFLmg/7.png\" alt=\"沙漠村庄全景\" width=\"946\" height=\"488\" /><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/93dX39Q/8.png\" alt=\"沙漠村庄侧视图\" width=\"947\" height=\"489\" /><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/gZdLhQy/9.png\" alt=\"沙漠村庄集市\" width=\"946\" height=\"488\" /><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/NKNZ0cn/10.png\" alt=\"沙漠村庄制图师小屋\" width=\"946\" height=\"488\" /><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/8Nhr8p3/11.png\" alt=\"沙漠村庄图书馆\" width=\"945\" height=\"488\" /><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/PmkSt9x/4.png\" alt=\"热带草原村庄\" width=\"946\" height=\"488\" /><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/wwM2nfT/5.png\" alt=\"热带草原村庄侧视图\" width=\"946\" height=\"488\" /><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/3RSgdJq/6.png\" alt=\"热带草原村庄武器匠视角\" width=\"947\" height=\"489\" /><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/ChwtS36/12.png\" alt=\"积雪村庄全景\" width=\"948\" height=\"489\" /><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/09rZWDW/13.png\" alt=\"积雪村庄全景 版本2\" width=\"950\" height=\"490\" /></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/3530fDGj/hidden-secrets-and-easter-eggs.png\" alt=\"隐藏的秘密与彩蛋\" border=\"0\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>图书馆之谜：</strong>探索村庄图书馆，揭开隐藏的秘密，发现精心设计的彩蛋。</li>\n<li><strong>互动发现：</strong>与新的互动元素互动，触发特殊事件或获得珍贵奖励。</li>\n</ul>\n</ul>\n</ul>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"https://url-shortener.curseforge.com/seMy8\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/cvqfFqD/lovbisect.png\" alt=\"lovbisect\" width=\"803\" height=\"77\"> </a></p>\n<img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/fV6VtS4Q/youtube-reviews.png\" alt=\"youtube评测\" border=\"0\" width=\"605\" height=\"44\">\n<details>\n<summary>剧透</summary>\n<p>-17分25秒评测-</p>\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/4GQ9mz_q8ko\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n<p>-9分54秒评测-</p>\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/nFs0BDD85kw\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n<p>-2分52秒评测-</p>\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/VTaizc8Gsmc\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n</details>\n<h2><a href=\"https://discord.com/invite/pGkUmgGcsY\"><br /><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/qDNhg49/636e0a6a49cf127bf92de1e2-icon-clyde-blurple-RGB.png\" width=\"128\" height=\"97\" /><br /></a></h2>\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/DPxQHNKk/usage.png\" alt=\"使用方法\" width=\"692\" height=\"48\" border=\"0\"></p>\n<p>欢迎随意将 <strong>Lio's Overhauled Villages</strong> 用于您选择的任何 Minecraft 整合包。我们鼓励您将本模组加入自定义整合包中，打造多样且精彩的游玩体验。无需申请明确授权，尽情享受焕然一新的村庄吧！</p>",
